cells:
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "**Note: Try to avoid *GROUP BY* clause to solve the problems**\r

      \r

      For the problems use the *Health Insurance Claim* dataset. You can get the
      details as well as the dataset from
      [here](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/thedevastator/insurance-claim-anal\
      ysis-demographic-and-health).\r\n"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "\r

      ### **Problem 1:** What are the top 5 patients who claimed the highest
      insurance amounts?\r\n"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 2
    languageId: sql
    value: "SELECT *,\r

      DENSE_RANK() OVER( )\r

      FROM insurance"
